e="#14XX"></dc:date><dc:type rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/concept/2936"></dc:type><edm:europeanaProxy>true</edm:europeanaProxy><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_csg_1091"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/9200211/en_list_one_csg_1091"/><edm:type>TEXT</edm:type></ore:Proxy><ore:Proxy rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/proxy/provider/9200211/en_list_one_csg_1091"><dc:coverage>St. Gall (?)</dc:coverage><dc:date>15th century (?)</dc:date><dc:description>Seven wooden tablets, bound together each between two later-added front and back paper guard leaves; the first tablet is filled only on the verso side with black-dyed wax, the following five are filled on both sides, the last is not filled. The format of the wooden tablets without the paper reinforcements is 14.8 x 8 cm. According to Wilhelm Wattenbach (in: Anzeiger für Kunde der deutschen Vorzeit 1873, p. 79f.), the tablets probably are “Bruchstücke des Taschenbuchs eines Klosterbeamten aus dem 15. Jahrh.” (pieces of the broken pocket book of a monastery official from the 15th century); several Latin and German words (partly upside-down) can be guessed.</dc:description><dc:format>IV + 14 + IV pp., 14.8 x 10.5 cm</dc:format><dc:identifier>doi:10.5076/e-codices-csg-1091</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/csg/1091</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>St. Gallen, Stiftsbibliothek, Cod. Sang. 1091</dc:identifier><dc:publisher>e-codices - Virtual Manuscript Library of Switzerland</dc:publisher><dc:language>not specified</dc:language><dc:rights>e-codices / St. Gallen, Stiftsbibliothek (cf. http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/about/terms)</dc:rights><dc:source rdf:resource="http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/csg/1091"></dc:source><dc:title>St. Gallen, Stiftsbibliothek, Cod. Sang. 1091 : Book of wax tablets</dc:title><dc:type>Tablets</dc:type><dcterms:medium>Wood and wax</dcterms:medium><edm:europeana